            lines {
              text: "    explanation: {"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "      coreConcept: \'Conclusion I follows because \"Some soldiers are officers\" + \"All officers are commanders\" -> overlap exists between commanders and soldiers. Conclusion III follows because all officers are commanders and no commander is a civilian, meaning no officer can ever be a civilian (thus some/all officers are not civilians). Conclusion II does not follow as a definite certainty because civilians and soldiers can still have common elements outside commanders.\',"
