  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Frontend Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on designing the frontend components. I\'ve begun to consider specific components for the application, starting with `Navbar.tsx`. I\'ll create a `Navbar` component. It\'ll have the brand \"DutyDeck\" along with a \"UPSC CAPF AC & SSC CPO Dual Prep\" badge. I\'m also planning an active tab switch functionality.\n\n\n**Developing Feature Breakdown**\n\nI\'m now diving deeper into the specifics, defining key features. I\'m prioritizing \"Dual Overview\" with overlap metrics and the \"CPO Speed Drill\". I\'m also thinking through \"CAPF Elimination\" and \"Paper 2 Lab\". I\'m also planning the \"AI Topic Breakdown\". Lastly, I\'m working through the \"Mistake Vault & SRS\" feature for targeted learning. I\'m considering a quick stats pill with key performance indicators. The Bento-style `OverviewDashboard` is taking shape too.\n\n\n**Defining Specific Features**\n\nI\'ve been working on concrete feature definitions now. I\'m focusing on the \"15-Min CPO Sprint\" mode which will have a strict timer, question grid, speed tracking per question, and instant score reports with negative marking. I\'m designing an \"elimination mode\" that supports statement and option scratchpads and smart UPSC heuristic suggestions. I\'m also planning the \"Practice Statement Elimination\" function, \"AI Teach a Topic\" feature, and a way to \"Draft Paper 2 Counter-Argument\".\n\n\n**Refining Content Integration**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating content and developing new components. I\'m adding detailed conceptual explanations and trap alerts for specific chapters. The `Paper2Lab.tsx` component is shaping up, featuring a timed markdown editor, topic selector, and structure scaffolding checkers for various essay types. I\'m also planning a Gemini AI evaluation trigger for comprehensive feedback. The `AiTopicBreakdown.tsx` component will feature a \"Break Topic Down Easy\" function, allowing for personalized syllabus tutoring via AI.\n\n\n**Elaborating Feature Functionality**\n\nI\'m expanding the features of the learning platform now. I\'m focusing on \"Explain Like I\'m New\" with high intuition, incorporating an ELI5 section, analytical UPSC depth, SSC CPO shortcuts, memory hooks, and common examiner trap alerts. I\'m also building \"Generate Targeted Practice Drill on this Topic\" using the Gemini API to create practice questions. The `MistakeVault.tsx` component now includes micro-topic and reason filters, retry options, and AI mistake diagnosis. I am also working on `SeedMistakeModal.tsx`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2028492308145915783"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { \\n  Compass, \\n  Zap, \\n  CheckSquare, \\n  PenTool, \\n  Sparkles, \\n  Archive, \\n  ShieldCheck, \\n  Flame\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\nexport type NavTab = \'OVERVIEW\' | \'CPO_SPEED\' | \'CAPF_ELIMINATION\' | \'PAPER_2\' | \'AI_TUTOR\' | \'MISTAKE_VAULT\';\\n\\ninterface NavbarProps {\\n  activeTab: NavTab;\\n  onTabChange: (tab: NavTab) => void;\\n  vaultCount: number;\\n  completedQuestionsCount: number;\\n  streakDays: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Navbar: React.FC<NavbarProps> = ({\\n  activeTab,\\n  onTabChange,\\n  vaultCount,\\n  completedQuestionsCount,\\n  streakDays,\\n}) => {\\n  const navItems = [\\n    { id: \'OVERVIEW\' as NavTab, label: \'Dual Overview\', icon: Compass },\\n    { id: \'CPO_SPEED\' as NavTab, label: \'CPO Speed (15m)\', icon: Zap, badge: \'CBT\' },\\n    { id: \'CAPF_ELIMINATION\' as NavTab, label: \'CAPF Elimination\', icon: CheckSquare, badge: \'P1\' },\\n    { id: \'PAPER_2\' as NavTab, label: \'Paper 2 Lab\', icon: PenTool, badge: \'Descriptive\' },\\n    { id: \'AI_TUTOR\' as NavTab, label: \'AI Syllabus Tutor\', icon: Sparkles, highlight: true },\\n    { id: \'MISTAKE_VAULT\' as NavTab, label: \'Mistake Vault & SRS\', icon: Archive, count: vaultCount },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-40 bg-[#FFFFFF]/90 dark:bg-[#121816]/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-[#E2E6DD] dark:border-slate-800 transition-colors\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between h-16\\\">\\n          \\n          {/* Logo & Brand Identity */}\\n          <div \\n            onClick={() => onTabChange(\'OVERVIEW\')}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer group\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#36624B] flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-sm shadow-[#36624B]/20 group-hover:bg-[#2A4F3C] transition-all\\\">\\n              <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-[#E3EFE8]\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-bold text-lg tracking-tight text-[#1E252B] dark:text-white font-sans\\\">\\n                  DutyDeck\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#E3EFE8] text-[#36624B] dark:bg-[#1A2E24] dark:text-[#88D4A8] border border-[#36624B]/15\\\">\\n                  CAPF AC \303\227 CPO\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-400 font-medium\\\">\\n                Dual-Target Objective & Subjective Engine\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Quick Metrics Bar */}\\n          <div className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-4 text-xs\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#F7F8F5] dark:bg-[#1A2420] border border-[#E2E6DD] dark:border-slate-800 text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n              <Flame className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#D97746]\\\" />\\n              <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-[#1E252B] dark:text-white\\\">{streakDays}</span> Day Routine\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#F7F8F5] dark:bg-[#1A2420] border border-[#E2E6DD] dark:border-slate-800 text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#2E7D5B]\\\"></span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-[#1E252B] dark:text-white\\\">{completedQuestionsCount}</span> Solved\\n            </div>\\n            {vaultCount > 0 && (\\n              <div \\n                onClick={() => onTabChange(\'MISTAKE_VAULT\')}\\n                className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#FBEAE8] text-[#C25345] border border-[#C25345]/20 cursor-pointer hover:bg-[#F8DED9] transition-all\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span className=\\\"font-semibold\\\">{vaultCount}</span> in Vault\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Navigation Tabs (Scrollable on mobile) */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"flex space-x-1 sm:space-x-2 overflow-x-auto py-2 no-scrollbar border-t border-[#E2E6DD]/60 dark:border-slate-800/60\\\">\\n          {navItems.map((item) => {\\n            const Icon = item.icon;\\n            const isActive = activeTab === item.id;\\n            return (\\n              <button\\n                key={item.id}\\n                onClick={() => onTabChange(item.id)}\\n                className={`flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap transition-all duration-150 ${\\n                  isActive\\n                    ? \'bg-[#36624B] text-white shadow-sm shadow-[#36624B]/25\'\\n                    : item.highlight\\n                    ? \'text-[#36624B] dark:text-[#88D4A8] bg-[#E3EFE8]/70 dark:bg-[#1A2E24]/60 hover:bg-[#E3EFE8]\'\\n                    : \'text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-[#1E252B] dark:hover:text-white hover:bg-[#F2F4F0] dark:hover:bg-[#1A2420]\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <Icon className={`w-3.5 h-3.5 ${isActive ? \'text-white\' : item.highlight ? \'text-[#36624B] dark:text-[#88D4A8]\' : \'text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-400\'}`} />\\n                <span>{item.label}</span>\\n                {item.badge && (\\n                  <span className={`text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded font-mono ${\\n                    isActive ? \'bg-white/20 text-white\' : \'bg-[#EEF0EA] dark:bg-slate-800 text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                  }`}>\\n                    {item.badge}\\n                  </sp