ef=e381]: \"\\\"While the primacy of border guarding demands that CAPFs remain dedicated to external frontier surveillance, sporadic domestic deployment requires formal inter-state coordination councils to prevent operational fatigue and preserve high-altitude acclimatization.\\\"\"\n  - contentinfo [ref=e240]:\n    - generic [ref=e241]:\n      - generic [ref=e242]:\n        - generic [ref=e243]: DutyDeck\n        - generic [ref=e244]: \342\200\242 Dual-Target Preparation Engine for UPSC CAPF AC & SSC CPO\n      - generic [ref=e245]: Nordic Botanical Theme \342\200\242 15-Minute Section Gates \342\200\242 Elimination Scratchpad\n```\n\n### Log (.playwright-cli/console-2026-11-12T11-44-39-598Z.log#L1-L1)\n```\n[     461ms] [INFO] %cDownload the React DevTools for a better development experience: https://react.dev/link/react-devtools font-weight:bold @ http://localhost:3000/node_modules/.vite/deps/react-dom_client.js?v=88752353:15801\n```\n\n<attached-media>\nimage/png /.aistudio/artifacts/brain/11de2bb8-3d03-41f4-b9b1-31ec81e6ffef/.tempmediaStorage/r10-paper2-graded.png\n</attached-media>\n"
