  planner_response {
    response: "### DutyDeck \342\200\224 UPSC CAPF AC & SSC CPO Dual Prep Engine\n\n**DutyDeck** is built specifically to bridge the dual demands of **UPSC CAPF AC** (multi-statement elimination depth, subjective Paper 2 argument drafting) and **SSC CPO** (15-minute high-speed CBT sectional sprints, 30-second formula shortcuts), styled in the **Nordic Botanical** (Cloud Bone, Deep Slate, Deep Sage Green `#36624B`, Mint Wash, Nordic Teal, Soft Apricot Clay) aesthetic.\n\n---\n\n### Core Architecture & Delivered Features\n\n1. **Dual-Mode Objective Engine**:\n   - **CPO Speed Mode (15-Min CBT Sprint)**:\n     - Strict 15-minute auto-locking sectional countdown timer replicating the Paper 1 CBT interface.\n     - Individual question speed-clock with automatic **Speed Alerts (`>45s`)** to train rapid pace.\n     - Instant formula shortcuts (e.g. 2-year and 3-year CI vs SI difference $D = P(R/100)^2$, relative speed on circular tracks, multiplier discounts).\n     - Standard SSC CPO negative marking (+1.00 correct, -0.25 incorrect).\n   - **CAPF Deep-Dive Elimination Engine (UPSC Standard)**:\n     - Authentic multi-statement format (Statements 1, 2, 3 with \"1 only\", \"1 and 2 only\", etc.).\n     - **Interactive Elimination Scratchpad**: Click any statement to cross it out as false.\n     - **Auto-Deduction Engine**: Striking out Statement 2 immediately marks options mentioning \"2\" as eliminated and highlights single-remaining option breakthroughs.\n     - Standard book citations for every question (*M. Laxmikanth Indian Polity*, *Spectrum Modern History*, *NCERT Physical Geography*).\n\n2. **Personal AI Syllabus Tutor (\"Break Topic Down Easy\")**:\n   - Integrated with **Gemini 3.8 Flash** via server-side endpoints (`/api/ai/breakdown` & `/api/ai/generate-questions`).\n   - **5-Part Intuitive Teaching Model**:\n     1. **Core Intuition / ELI5**: 3 plain-English bullet points.\n     2. **UPSC Analytical Depth**: Articles (352, 356, 360, 33, 34), Supreme Court cases (*Minerva Mills*, *Bommai*), and MHA border security mandates.\n     3. **SSC CPO Speed Formula / Shortcut**: 30-second mental math rules.\n     4. **Unforgettable Memory Hook / Mnemonic**: e.g., *\"WAR-20-21-UNTOUCHABLE\"*.\n     5. **Examiner Distractor Trap**: Exposing wording tricks that cause negative marking.\n   - **Personalized Practice Question Generator**: Aspirants can enter their specific learning gap or select a syllabus sub-topic to generate tailored 3-question adaptive drills.\n\n3. **CAPF Paper 2 \"Argument & Structure Lab\"**:\n   - Timed markdown writing desk with countdown clock (20-minute simulated blocks).\n   - **Structure Scaffolding Checkers**:\n     - **Argument Splitter**: Enforces the 4-part split: *Intro / Context &rarr; Arguments FOR &rarr; Arguments AGAINST &rarr; Balanced Conclusion*.\n     - **Report Formatter**: Pre-formats standard UPSC headers (*Date, Place, Special Correspondent*).\n     - **Pr\303\251cis 1/3 Rule Counter**: Live target word counter tracking the 33% threshold with \302\26110% tolerance indicators.\n   - **AI Rubric Grader (`/api/ai/evaluate-paper2`)**:\n     - Official 20-mark evaluation breakdown: Structure (6M), Constitutional/Factual Depth (8M), Tone & Grammar (6M).\n     - **Objective Tone & Administrative Neutrality Audit** flagging partisan or emotional rhetoric.\n     - Model answer paragraph snippet for comparison.\n\n4. **Micro-Categorized PYQ Bank & Mistake Vault (SRS)**:\n   - Automated error taxonomy tagging: **Conceptual Gap**, **Misread Question**, or **Calculation/Time Panic**.\n   - **Spaced Repetition System (SRS)**: Auto-schedules reviews at 1-day, 3-day, and 7-day intervals based on retry performance.\n   - **Revision Filters**: Filter by *Due for Review*, *Conceptual Gaps Only*, or *Missed Twice or More*.\n   - **AI Mistake Diagnostic (`/api/ai/diagnose-mistake`)**: Explains why the selected option was a psychological distractor and provides a 1-minute prevention rule.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n\n- **Unit Tests**: Executed 6 unit tests with `node:test` covering CBT marking schemes, UPSC elimination heuristics, SRS intervals, pr\303\251cis compliance math, and argument section detection (all 6 passed).\n- **Browser Automation Verification (`playwright-cli`)**:\n  - *Overview Page*: Verified dual-target readiness indicators, overlap progress matrix, and high-yield topic selectors.\n  - *CPO Speed Mode*: Verified 15-minute countdown clock, live question timer, and CBT Question Matrix palette.\n  - *CAPF Elimination Engine*: Verified clicking Statement 2 crossed it out, displayed the green *UPSC Elimination Breakthrough* banner, and struck out Options A, C, and D automatically.\n  - *Paper 2 Desk*: Verified argument scaffold insertion, word count meter, and 20-mark AI rubric evaluation report.\n  - *AI Syllabus Tutor*: Tested topic breakdown generation and dynamic practice question rendering.\n  - *Mistake Vault*: Verified error taxonomy breakdown and SRS due-date filters.\n  - *Mobile Reflow*: Verified single-column responsiveness on 390x844 viewport."
    modified_response: "### DutyDeck \342\200\224 UPSC CAPF AC & SSC CPO Dual Prep Engine\n\n**DutyDeck** is built specifically to bridge the dual demands of **UPSC CAPF AC** (multi-statement elimination depth, subjective Paper 2 argument drafting) and **SSC CPO** (15-minute high-speed CBT sectional sprints, 30-second formula shortcuts), styled in the **Nordic Botanical** (Cloud Bone, Deep Slate, Deep Sage Green `#36624B`, Mint Wash, Nordic Teal, Soft Apricot Clay) aesthetic.\n\n---\n\n### Core Architecture & Delivered Features\n\n1. **Dual-Mode Objective Engine**:\n   - **CPO Speed Mode (15-Min CBT Sprint)**:\n     - Strict 15-minute auto-locking sectional countdown timer replicating the Paper 1 CBT interface.\n     - Individual question speed-clock with automatic **Speed Alerts (`>45s`)** to train rapid pace.\n     - Instant formula shortcuts (e.g. 2-year and 3-year CI vs SI difference $D = P(R/100)^2$, relative speed on circular tracks, multiplier discounts).\n     - Standard SSC CPO negative marking (+1.00 correct, -0.25 incorrect).\n   - **CAPF Deep-Dive Elimination Engine (UPSC Standard)**:\n     - Authentic multi-statement format (Statements 1, 2, 3 with \"1 only\", \"1 and 2 only\", etc.).\n     - **Interactive Elimination Scratchpad**: Click any statement to cross it out as false.\n     - **Auto-Deduction Engine**: Striking out Statement 2 immediately marks options mentioning \"2\" as eliminated and highlights single-remaining option breakthroughs.\n     - Standard book citations for every question (*M. Laxmikanth Indian Polity*, *Spectrum Modern History*, *NCERT Physical Geography*).\n\n2. **Personal AI Syllabus Tutor (\"Break Topic Down Easy\")**:\n   - Integrated with **Gemini 3.8 Flash** via server-side endpoints (`/api/ai/breakdown` & `/api/ai/generate-questions`).\n   - **5-Part Intuitive Teaching Model**:\n     1. **Core Intuition / ELI5**: 3 plain-English bullet points.\n     2. **UPSC Analytical Depth**: Articles (352, 356, 360, 33, 34), Supreme Court cases (*Minerva Mills*, *Bommai*), and MHA border security mandates.\n     3. **SSC CPO Speed Formula / Shortcut**: 30-second mental math rules.\n     4. **Unforgettable Memory Hook / Mnemonic**: e.g., *\"WAR-20-21-UNTOUCHABLE\"*.\n     5. **Examiner Distractor Trap**: Exposing wording tricks that cause negative marking.\n   - **Personalized Practice Question Generator**: Aspirants can enter their specific learning gap or select a syllabus sub-topic to generate tailored 3-question adaptive drills.\n\n3. **CAPF Paper 2 \"Argument & Structure Lab\"**:\n   - Timed markdown writing desk with countdown clock (20-minute simulated blocks).\n   - **Structure Scaffolding Checkers**:\n     - **Argument Splitter**: Enforces the 4-part split: *Intro / Context &rarr; Arguments FOR &rarr; Arguments AGAINST &rarr; Balanced Conclusion*.\n     - **Report Formatter**: Pre-formats standard UPSC headers (*Date, Place, Special Correspondent*).\n     - **Pr\303\251cis 1/3 Rule Counter**: Live target word counter tracking the 33% threshold with \302\26110% tolerance indicators.\n   - **AI Rubric Grader (`/api/ai/evaluate-paper2`)**:\n     - Official 20-mark evaluation breakdown: Structure (6M), Constitutional/Factual Depth (8M), Tone & Grammar (6M).\n     - **Objective Tone & Administrative Neutrality Audit** flagging partisan or emotional rhetoric.\n     - Model answer paragraph snippet for comparison.\n\n4. **Micro-Categorized PYQ Bank & Mistake Vault (SRS)**:\n   - Automated error taxonomy tagging: **Conceptual Gap**, **Misread Question**, or **Calculation/Time Panic**.\n   - **Spaced Repetition System (SRS)**: Auto-schedules reviews at 1-day, 3-day, and 7-day intervals based on retry performance.\n   - **Revision Filters**: Filter by *Due for Review*, *Conceptual Gaps Only*, or *Missed Twice or More*.\n   - **AI Mistake Diagnostic (`/api/ai/diagnose-mistake`)**: Explains why the selected option was a psychological distractor and provides a 1-minute prevention rule.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n\n- **Unit Tests**: Executed 6 unit tests with `node:test` covering CBT marking schemes, UPSC elimination heuristics, SRS intervals, pr\303\251cis compliance math, and argument section detection (all 6 passed).\n- **Browser Automation Verification (`playwright-cli`)**:\n  - *Overview Page*: Verified dual-target readiness indicators, overlap progress matrix, and high-yield topic selectors.\n  - *CPO Speed Mode*: Verified 15-minute countdown clock, live question timer, and CBT Question Matrix palette.\n  - *CAPF Elimination Engine*: Verified clicking Statement 2 crossed it out, displayed the green *UPSC Elimination Breakthrough* banner, and struck out Options A, C, and D automatically.\n  - *Paper 2 Desk*: Verified argument scaffold insertion, word count meter, and 20-mark AI rubric evaluation report.\n  - *AI Syllabus Tutor*: Tested topic breakdown generation and dynamic practice question rendering.\n  - *Mistake Vault*: Verified error taxonomy breakdown and SRS due-date filters.\n  - *Mobile Reflow*: Verified single-column responsiveness on 390x844 viewport."
