  planner_response {
    response: "### DutyDeck \342\200\224 UPSC CAPF AC & SSC CPO Dual Prep Web App\n\nA dual-target prep suite structured around the **overlap** (Polity, History, Geography, General Science, English) and **divergence** (SSC CPO 15-minute speed arithmetic vs. UPSC CAPF multi-statement elimination & Paper 2 argument drafting), styled in the **Nordic Botanical** (Sage & Warm Slate) theme.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built\n\n1. **Dual-Mode Objective Engines**:\n   - **SSC CPO Speed CBT Sprint**:\n     - Strict 15-minute sectional countdown with auto-locking gate.\n     - Per-question speed clock with **speed alerts for questions exceeding 45 seconds**.\n     - CBT Question Palette (Answered, Marked for Review, Unattempted).\n     - Direct formula & 30-second mental shortcuts shown post-submission with negative marking calculation (+1 / -0.25).\n   - **UPSC CAPF Elimination Engine**:\n     - Authentic multi-statement format (Statements 1, 2, 3: *\"Which of the statements given above is/are correct?\"*).\n     - **Interactive Elimination Scratchpad**: Click statements to strike them through as FALSE.\n     - **Automated UPSC Deduction Clue**: Eliminating a statement immediately flags and eliminates dependent options, highlighting 100% mathematical breakthroughs.\n     - Direct book citations (*M. Laxmikanth, Spectrum, NCERT*).\n\n2. **CAPF Paper 2 \"Argument & Structure Lab\"**:\n   - **Timed Markdown Desk**: Fixed 20-minute countdown for Counter-Arguments, Reports, Essays, and Pr\303\251cis.\n   - **Structure Scaffolding Checkers**:\n     - **Argument Splitter**: Enforces Intro $\\to$ 3 Points FOR $\\to$ 3 Points AGAINST $\\to$ Balanced Conclusion.\n     - **Report Formatter**: Pre-formats standard official header (*Date, Place, Special Correspondent*).\n     - **Pr\303\251cis 1/3 Rule Compliance**: Live word counter calculating exact 33% target and $\\pm 10\\%$ tolerance band against the original passage.\n   - **Gemini Rubric Evaluation API**: Scores submissions out of 20 marks across Structure (6M), Constitutional/Factual Depth (8M), and Neutral Tone (6M), flagging emotional or partisan bias and providing a model answer paragraph.\n\n3. **AI Syllabus Tutor (\"Break Topic Down Easy\")**:\n   - Interactive Syllabus Explorer covering Shared Core, CPO Speed, and CAPF tracks.\n   - **Easy Mode Topic Breakdown**:\n     - **ELI5 Intuition**: 3 plain-English bullet points.\n     - **UPSC Analytical Angle**: Constitutional Articles, Supreme Court cases, border security mandates.\n     - **SSC CPO Speed Shortcut**: Mental math shortcuts and 30-second identification tricks.\n     - **Unforgettable Memory Hook / Mnemonic**: High-yield recall aids.\n     - **Classic Examiner Distractor Trap**: Highlighting trick wording that induces negative marks.\n   - **Targeted Practice Question Generator**: Dynamically generates 3 practice questions tailored to your specific learning gap.\n\n4. **Micro-Categorized PYQ Bank & Mistake Vault**:\n   - **Error Taxonomy**: Every missed question is tagged as *Conceptual Gap*, *Misread Question*, or *Calculation/Time Panic*.\n   - **Spaced Repetition System (SRS)**: Automated review schedules at 1-day, 3-day, and 7-day intervals.\n   - **Revision Filters**: Filter by *Due Today*, *Conceptual Gaps Only*, or *Missed Twice or More*.\n   - **AI Distractor Diagnostic**: Explains why a specific distractor was chosen and provides a 1-minute prevention rule.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n\n- **Unit Tests (`node:test` via `tsx`)**: 6/6 tests passing in 273ms covering CBT score calculations (+1/-0.25 and +2/-0.67), speed warning flags (>45s), statement elimination heuristics, SRS intervals, pr\303\251cis word compliance, and argument section detection.\n- **Browser Automation Verification**: Verified live desktop (1440x900) and mobile (390x844) viewports:\n  - Verified CPO Speed 15-minute countdown and question matrix.\n  - Verified CAPF scratchpad statement elimination and automated option strike-out.\n  - Verified Paper 2 live argument scaffolding and evaluation report generation.\n  - Verified AI Syllabus Tutor concept breakdowns and dynamic 3-question drill generation.\n- **Build & Types**: Clean TypeScript compilation (`tsc --noEmit`) and Vite bundle build."
