t of 20 marks across Structure (6M), Constitutional/Factual Depth (8M), and Neutral Tone (6M), flagging emotional or partisan bias and providing a model answer paragraph.\n\n3. **AI Syllabus Tutor (\"Break Topic Down Easy\")**:\n   - Interactive Syllabus Explorer covering Shared Core, CPO Speed, and CAPF tracks.\n   - **Easy Mode Topic Breakdown**:\n     - **ELI5 Intuition**: 3 plain-English bullet points.\n     - **UPSC Analytical Angle**: Constitutional Articles, Supreme Court cases, border security mandates.\n     - **SSC CPO Speed Shortcut**: Mental math shortcuts and 30-second identification tricks.\n     - **Unforgettable Memory Hook / Mnemonic**: High-yield recall aids.\n     - **Classic Examiner Distractor Trap**: Highlighting trick wording that induces negative marks.\n   - **Targeted Practice Question Generator**: Dynamically generates 3 practice questions tailored to your specific learning gap.\n\n4. **Micro-Categorized PYQ Bank & Mistake Vault**:\n   - **Error Taxonomy**: Every missed question is tagged as *Conceptual Gap*, *Misread Question*, or *Calculation/Time Panic*.\n   - **Spaced Repetition System (SRS)**: Automated review schedules at 1-day, 3-day, and 7-day intervals.\n   - **Revision Filters**: Filter by *Due Today*, *Conceptual Gaps Only*, or *Missed Twice or More*.\n   - **AI Distractor Diagnostic**: Explains why a specific distractor was chosen and provides a 1-minute prevention rule.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n\n- **Unit Tests (`node:test` via `tsx`)**: 6/6 tests passing in 273ms covering CBT score calculations (+1/-0.25 and +2/-0.67), speed warning flags (>45s), statement elimination heuristics, SRS intervals, pr\303\251cis word compliance, and argument section detection.\n- **Browser Automation Verification**: Verified live desktop (1440x900) and mobile (390x844) viewports:\n  - Verified CPO Speed 15-minute countdown and question matrix.\n  - Verified CAPF scratchpad statement elimination and automated option strike-out.\n  - Verified Paper 2 live argument scaffolding and evaluation report generation.\n  - Verified AI Syllabus Tutor concept breakdowns and dynamic 3-question drill generation.\n- **Build & Types**: Clean TypeScript compilation (`tsc --noEmit`) and Vite bundle build."
