    thinking: "**Considering User Configuration**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting a configuration UI for the AI Tutor. The key is allowing users to manually adjust the \'Statement Depth\' \342\200\223 essentially, controlling the complexity of generated questions. Right now I\'m considering a clear slider or dropdown, perhaps with helpful tooltips explaining the implications of different depth levels. This manual control will give users significant flexibility, catering to both basic recall and deeper understanding prompts.\n\n\n"
