    thinking: "**Adding Statement Depth Control**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the Adaptive Question Generation Trigger Box. I\'ve decided to incorporate a manual Statement Depth configuration bar directly into it. The options will include: 1 Stmt for Factual Recall, 2 Stmts for Foundational understanding, 3 Stmts for Standard UPSC, and 4 Stmts for Complex Analysis.\n\n\n"
