  planner_response {
    response: "### Immersive Study Analytics & Syllabus Matrix Panel\n\nAn immersive, psychologically motivating **Analytics & Syllabus Matrix Panel** has been built into DutyDeck to drive consistent study habits and give clear visibility across exam sections, subjects, and topics.\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities Built\n\n1. **Dual-Exam Readiness Gauges & Aspirant Mission Control**:\n   - **UPSC CAPF AC Readiness Index**: Calculates live readiness combining Paper 1 multi-statement analytical elimination accuracy, conceptual coverage, and Paper 2 subjective argument scoring.\n   - **SSC CPO Speed Readiness Index**: Real-time CBT velocity index measuring $<45$s question pacing, Quant shortcut proficiency, and Reasoning speed.\n   - **14-Day Study Consistency Heatmap & Streak Tracker**: Visual daily tracker reflecting unbroken discipline streaks (e.g. \360\237\224\245 4-day routine) and estimated focused study hours.\n   - **Weekly Study Milestone**: Interactive target progress meter (e.g. 30 questions weekly benchmark) to build subconscious elimination habits.\n\n2. **AI \"Next Best Study Move\" (Psychological Study Driver)**:\n   - Evaluates the aspirant\'s current performance bottlenecks (e.g. SRS due items, unattempted speed gates, or Paper 2 arguments) and serves an actionable high-yield recommendation with an estimated retention/score impact badge and a 1-click **\"Execute Study Action\"** button.\n\n3. **Multi-Level Syllabus Hierarchy (Sections $\\rightarrow$ Subjects $\\rightarrow$ Subtopics)**:\n   - **Section Filter Tabs**: Switch dynamically between **All Sections**, **Shared Core** (overlapping between CAPF and CPO), **UPSC CAPF Track** (P1 Analytical & Paper 2), and **SSC CPO Track** (Quant & Reasoning speed).\n   - **6 Core Subject Performance Cards**:\n     - *Polity & Constitution*, *Modern History*, *Quantitative Aptitude*, *Reasoning & Intelligence*, *Geography & Environment*, and *Paper 2 (Subjective)*.\n     - Each card displays a Mastery Index progress bar, Solved vs Bank count, Accuracy %, and an **Error Taxonomy Breakdown** (Conceptual Gaps, Misread Questions, and Time Panic).\n     - Clicking any subject card instantly filters the subtopic matrix below.\n   - **Interactive Subtopic Progress Matrix (17 High-Yield Topics)**:\n     - Live search bar by topic name, standard book reference (*M. Laxmikanth*, *Spectrum*, *NCERT*), or key constitutional concepts.\n     - Weightage badges (*High / Medium*), status indicators (*Mastered, Proficient, Developing, Unstarted*), and key concept previews.\n     - Direct action buttons on every topic: **\"Study with AI\"** (preloads topic into the AI Syllabus Tutor) and **\"Elimination\"** or **\"Speed Drill\"** (launches instant practice mode).\n\n4. **Gamified Aspirant Milestones & Service Badges**:\n   - 6 unlocked/in-progress badges:\n     - \360\237\224\245 **Discipline Sentinel**: Maintaining active routine streaks.\n     - \360\237\216\257 **Elimination Maestro**: Deductive mastery of multi-statement questions.\n     - \342\234\215\357\270\217 **Paper 2 Strategist**: Evaluated submissions in the subjective lab.\n     - \360\237\233\241\357\270\217 **Mistake Purifier**: Resolving due questions through Spaced Repetition (SRS).\n     - \342\232\241 **Speed Sprinter**: Completing quantitative drills under sectional time pressure.\n     - \360\237\216\226\357\270\217 **Centurion Aspirant**: Total syllabus coverage milestone.\n\n5. **Testing & Verification**:\n   - Implemented `src/utils/analyticsEngine.ts` and verified with unit tests in `src/utils/analyticsEngine.test.ts`. All 13 unit tests pass.\n   - Successfully compiled and linted with 0 errors (`compile_applet` and `lint_applet` passing).\n   - Headless browser automated inspection confirmed navigation from both the top navbar and the overview dashboard, real-time section filtering, and seamless transition from topic cards into the AI Syllabus Tutor."
    modified_response: "### Immersive Study Analytics & Syllabus Matrix Panel\n\nAn immersive, psychologically motivating **Analytics & Syllabus Matrix Panel** has been built into DutyDeck to drive consistent study habits and give clear visibility across exam sections, subjects, and topics.\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities Built\n\n1. **Dual-Exam Readiness Gauges & Aspirant Mission Control**:\n   - **UPSC CAPF AC Readiness Index**: Calculates live readiness combining Paper 1 multi-statement analytical elimination accuracy, conceptual coverage, and Paper 2 subjective argument scoring.\n   - **SSC CPO Speed Readiness Index**: Real-time CBT velocity index measuring $<45$s question pacing, Quant shortcut proficiency, and Reasoning speed.\n   - **14-Day Study Consistency Heatmap & Streak Tracker**: Visual daily tracker reflecting unbroken discipline streaks (e.g. \360\237\224\245 4-day routine) and estimated focused study hours.\n   - **Weekly Study Milestone**: Interactive target progress meter (e.g. 30 questions weekly benchmark) to build subconscious elimination habits.\n\n2. **AI \"Next Best Study Move\" (Psychological Study Driver)**:\n   - Evaluates the aspirant\'s current performance bottlenecks (e.g. SRS due items, unattempted speed gates, or Paper 2 arguments) and serves an actionable high-yield recommendation with an estimated retention/score impact badge and a 1-click **\"Execute Study Action\"** button.\n\n3. **Multi-Level Syllabus Hierarchy (Sections $\\rightarrow$ Subjects $\\rightarrow$ Subtopics)**:\n   - **Section Filter Tabs**: Switch dynamically between **All Sections**, **Shared Core** (overlapping between CAPF and CPO), **UPSC CAPF Track** (P1 Analytical & Paper 2), and **SSC CPO Track** (Quant & Reasoning speed).\n   - **6 Core Subject Performance Cards**:\n     - *Polity & Constitution*, *Modern History*, *Quantitative Aptitude*, *Reasoning & Intelligence*, *Geography & Environment*, and *Paper 2 (Subjective)*.\n     - Each card displays a Mastery Index progress bar, Solved vs Bank count, Accuracy %, and an **Error Taxonomy Breakdown** (Conceptual Gaps, Misread Questions, and Time Panic).\n     - Clicking any subject card instantly filters the subtopic matrix below.\n   - **Interactive Subtopic Progress Matrix (17 High-Yield Topics)**:\n     - Live search bar by topic name, standard book reference (*M. Laxmikanth*, *Spectrum*, *NCERT*), or key constitutional concepts.\n     - Weightage badges (*High / Medium*), status indicators (*Mastered, Proficient, Developing, Unstarted*), and key concept previews.\n     - Direct action buttons on every topic: **\"Study with AI\"** (preloads topic into the AI Syllabus Tutor) and **\"Elimination\"** or **\"Speed Drill\"** (launches instant practice mode).\n\n4. **Gamified Aspirant Milestones & Service Badges**:\n   - 6 unlocked/in-progress badges:\n     - \360\237\224\245 **Discipline Sentinel**: Maintaining active routine streaks.\n     - \360\237\216\257 **Elimination Maestro**: Deductive mastery of multi-statement questions.\n     - \342\234\215\357\270\217 **Paper 2 Strategist**: Evaluated submissions in the subjective lab.\n     - \360\237\233\241\357\270\217 **Mistake Purifier**: Resolving due questions through Spaced Repetition (SRS).\n     - \342\232\241 **Speed Sprinter**: Completing quantitative drills under sectional time pressure.\n     - \360\237\216\226\357\270\217 **Centurion Aspirant**: Total syllabus coverage milestone.\n\n5. **Testing & Verification**:\n   - Implemented `src/utils/analyticsEngine.ts` and verified with unit tests in `src/utils/analyticsEngine.test.ts`. All 13 unit tests pass.\n   - Successfully compiled and linted with 0 errors (`compile_applet` and `lint_applet` passing).\n   - Headless browser automated inspection confirmed navigation from both the top navbar and the overview dashboard, real-time section filtering, and seamless transition from topic cards into the AI Syllabus Tutor."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
