  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining User Data Structures**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `firebase-blueprint.json` structure, focusing on defining entities and Firestore. The initial entity I\'ve identified is `userProfile`, which will store crucial user data like `uid`, `email`, `displayName`, and `photoURL`. Next, I\'ll need to meticulously map out the relationship of the `userProfile` entity to the rest of the app\'s components.\n\n\n**Analyzing User Data Security**\n\nNow I\'m focusing on the Firebase security rules. I\'m prioritizing user data privacy by starting with a global safety net that denies all read/write operations by default. I\'ve defined helper functions for validation and user authentication checks. I am looking into security rules for each of the paths, such as the `users/{userId}` path. I am implementing validation and only allowing users to view and write their own data.\n\n\n**Refining Security Rules**\n\nI\'m now refining the security rules for user data in Firestore. I am focusing on the \"mistakes\" and \"submissions\" subcollections within each user\'s profile. I\'ve allowed signed-in users to read and write their mistakes and submissions. I\'m also ensuring users can update their profile information securely, with validation to prevent unauthorized changes. These rules are ready to be deployed via an RPC action.\n\n\n**Implementing Authentication Workflow**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the authentication aspect. I\'m building out a `GoogleAuthProvider` for the Google sign-in process, and creating a connection test function to ensure the Firebase configuration is valid. I\'m implementing an `AuthContext` or `useAuth()` hook which will listen to authentication state changes, and providing UI elements to support this, such as a Google sign-in button, and the user\'s avatar, name, and sign-out option. Crucially, I\'m focusing on syncing user data between local storage and Firestore on sign-in and sign-out to enable user data persistence.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8916171138437945804"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"{\\n  \\\"entities\\\": {\\n    \\\"userProfile\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"UserProfile\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User profile containing aspirant account data and study metrics\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Firebase Auth UID\\\" },\\n        \\\"email\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"format\\\": \\\"email\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"User email address\\\" },\\n        \\\"displayName\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"User display name\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 100 },\\n        \\\"photoURL\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Avatar URL\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 500 },\\n        \\\"streakDays\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Consecutive days study streak\\\" },\\n        \\\"solvedCount\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Total questions solved\\\" },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Account creation timestamp\\\" },\\n        \\\"updatedAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Last updated timestamp\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"uid\\\", \\\"email\\\"]\\n    },\\n    \\\"userMistake\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"UserMistake\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Mistake record saved in the Mistake Vault with SRS intervals\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"id\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Mistake unique ID\\\" },\\n        \\\"questionId\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Question ID\\\" },\\n        \\\"selectedAnswer\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"A\\\", \\\"B\\\", \\\"C\\\", \\\"D\\\"] },\\n        \\\"correctAnswer\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"A\\\", \\\"B\\\", \\\"C\\\", \\\"D\\\"] },\\n        \\\"timeSpentSeconds\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\" },\\n        \\\"reason\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"Conceptual Gap\\\", \\\"Misread Question\\\", \\\"Calculation/Time Panic\\\"] },\\n        \\\"timestamp\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\" },\\n        \\\"reviewCount\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\" },\\n        \\\"nextReviewDate\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\" },\\n        \\\"notes\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 500 }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"id\\\", \\\"questionId\\\", \\\"selectedAnswer\\\", \\\"correctAnswer\\\", \\\"reason\\\", \\\"timestamp\\\", \\\"reviewCount\\\", \\\"nextReviewDate\\\"]\\n    },\\n    \\\"paper2Submission\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Paper2Submission\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Descriptive Paper 2 essay, report, or argument submission\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"id\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n        \\\"userId\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n        \\\"topicType\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"ESSAY\\\", \\\"ARGUMENT\\\", \\\"REPORT\\\", \\\"PRECIS\\\"] },\\n        \\\"prompt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 500 },\\n        \\\"content\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"maxLength\\\": 10000 },\\n        \\\"wordCount\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\" },\\n        \\\"timeSpentSeconds\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\" },\\n        \\\"submittedAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"number\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"id\\\", \\\"userId\\\", \\\"topicType\\\", \\\"prompt\\\", \\\"content\\\", \\\"wordCount\\\", \\\"submittedAt\\\"]\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"firestore\\\": {\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": \\\"userProfile\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Primary user profile document\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/mistakes/{mistakeId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": \\\"userMistake\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User\'s mistake vault records tracked by spaced repetition\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}/submissions/{submissionId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": \\\"paper2Submission\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User\'s evaluated subjective Paper 2 submissions\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create firebase-blueprint.json defining data models for user profile, mistakes, and submissions\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/firebase-blueprint.json\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating firebase blueprint\", \"toolSummary\":\"Define Firebase Blueprint IR\"}"
