            lines {
              text: "      \'Counter-argument writing tests an aspiring Assistant Commandant\342\200\231s cognitive objectivity. Evaluators strictly penalize candidates who take a one-sided, polemical stance. A high-scoring answer presents equal evidentiary rigor for both sides before delivering a pragmatic administrative synthesis.\',"
