  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining User Interaction**\n\nI\'m now focusing on user experience within the AI Topic Breakdown. Specifically, I\'m working to integrate a settings panel. I plan to allow users to toggle \"Question Statement Depth\" between simple and moderate, enhancing their ability to customize the module\'s responses.\n\n\n**Adjusting Generation Parameters**\n\nI\'m currently updating the AI generation prompt. I\'m incorporating new complexity parameters to handle different \"Question Statement Depth\" levels: Simple, Moderate, and Complex/UPSC. This adjustment will ensure that the AI can generate questions tailored to the user\'s selected difficulty level, optimizing the user experience.\n\n\n**Implementing Complexity Settings**\n\nI\'m now implementing explicit presets for question complexity: Simple, Moderate, and Complex/UPSC. These presets will be user-selectable. I\'m also adding parameters to manage statement depth and question complexity. The generation process will pass the selected complexity to the server, where the AI prompt and instructions will be adjusted accordingly to match the selected difficulty level.\n\n\n"
