  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Core Variables**\n\nI\'ve been working on defining key variables within AiTopicBreakdown. I\'ve established `complexityTier`, which can be \'Simple\', \'Moderate\', or \'Complex/UPSC\'. I\'ve also defined `selectedDepth` ranging from 1 to 4. I\'ve now linked `complexityTier` with `selectedDepth`: \'Simple\' tier corresponds to depth 1, \'Moderate\' corresponds to depth 2, and the third corresponds to a more complex depth.\n\n\n**Refining Feature Parameters**\n\nI\'m now integrating parameters into the system. The `showSettingsPanel` toggle has been added for user control. I\'m synchronizing `effectiveAssessment` with `complexityTier` and `selectedDepth`. Within `handleGenerateQuestions`, the fetch call has been updated to reflect these new variables. Specifically, parameters `complexityTier` and `statementDepth` are being synced, and other parameters are being incorporated.\n\n\n"
