  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Positioning the Panel**\n\nI\'ve decided to integrate the **Settings Panel** into `AiTopicBreakdown.tsx`. The optimal location seems to be adjacent to the Question Calibration, which is a key area. Specifically, the panel will live in the main control section, ideally just below the Adaptive Diagnostics HUD. It could even be an expandable settings card. I\'ve begun to consider the *Question Statement Depth* within this arrangement.\n\n\n**Refining Panel Structure**\n\nI\'m now focused on the exact structure of the settings panel. I\'m imagining a header with a `Settings` icon, status badge, and a \"Configure Settings / Collapse\" button. When expanded, there will be a prominent segmented card selector for the **Question Statement Depth**: \"Simple\", \"Moderate\", and \"Complex/UPSC\" with specific badges, subtitles, and descriptions for each level. Sub-selection for Exact Statements will also be included.\n\n\n"
