  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Settings Panel**\n\nI\'m focusing now on integrating the settings panel directly into the component. The plan is to create a dedicated, stylish card for \"Question Statement Depth & Calibration Settings\" above the topic selector or in the question generation box. It will be toggleable and clearly highlighted to draw attention to it.\n\n\n**Refining the Control Scheme**\n\nI\'m now implementing the detailed controls within the Settings Panel. The core will be a toggle for Question Statement Depth (Simple, Moderate, Complex/UPSC) with exact statement depth selection and question count options. I\'m incorporating a live prompt parameter preview and error display. Lines 670-713 in the question generation trigger box will be updated to reflect the three complexity tiers, syncing with `complexityTier`.\n\n\n"
