  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing the Layout**\n\nI\'m currently reviewing the layout, specifically focusing on updating Tile 2 (lines 328-380). I intend to insert the Settings Panel right after the diagnostics HUD, at line 424. I\'m thinking through the implications for the flow and user experience.\n\n\n**Analyzing the UI Element**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the \'Statement Depth\' UI element within Tile 2. I\'m analyzing the visual representation, specifically how the `complexityTier` and `manualDepth` are displayed. I\'m assessing the effectiveness of the visual depth bar and considering potential adjustments to improve clarity and user interaction, especially around the manual override feature.\n\n\n**Evaluating Depth Settings**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the manual override functionality within the depth settings. I\'m focusing on the logic behind setting `complexityTier` based on `depth` values, and the conditional rendering of the button. I\'m scrutinizing the tooltip content to ensure clarity for each depth level.\n\n\n**Integrating the Panel**\n\nI\'ve successfully integrated the question generation settings panel after line 424. I\'ve focused on the visual presentation of statement depths and the associated tooltips for clarity, including the interaction model for the manual override. I\'m considering visual cues for active and inactive depth levels.\n\n\n**Refining Panel Logic**\n\nI\'m now refining the logic associated with the question generation settings panel, paying close attention to how `complexityTier` is updated and how the display reflects it. I\'m focusing on ensuring accuracy in the display of depth and statement levels. I\'m considering the potential impact of different statement levels on the tooltips.\n\n\n**Finalizing Toggle Behavior**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the toggle interaction for statement depth within the settings panel. I\'m finalizing the logic for how each option (\"Simple,\" \"Moderate,\" \"Complex/UPSC\") impacts the AI prompt complexity. I\'m also ensuring the \"Configure Settings\" toggle\'s visual cues remain consistent with its purpose. The plan is to complete the function this morning.\n\n\n**Assessing Depth Controls**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the visual and functional aspects of depth controls. The \'Simple\', \'Moderate\', and \'Complex/UPSC\' options are under review to ensure their clarity and responsiveness to user input. I\'m assessing the conditional styling and ensuring the cursor changes for clarity. I\'m also ensuring the correct updates of `complexityTier`.\n\n\n**Examining Statement Styles**\n\nI\'m now carefully examining the styling for different statement depth options, specifically \"Simple\" in this instance. I\'m reviewing its visual representation to ensure its clarity and responsiveness to user selection, especially the associated tooltip content. I\'m focusing on consistency in the styling and its visual cues.\n\n\n**Analyzing the Logic**\n\nI\'m now carefully analyzing the logic associated with the \"Moderate\" statement style. I\'m focusing on the `onClick` handler and the conditional styling. I\'m assessing the effectiveness of visual cues and cursor changes for clarity. The objective is consistency in the visual representation and responsiveness to user selection.\n\n\n**Evaluating Statement Depths**\n\nI\'m now carefully evaluating the \"Complex/UPSC\" statement depth option. I\'m focusing on its visual representation, ensuring consistency with other options and the overall design. I\'m reviewing the tooltip and ensuring it accurately reflects the associated functionality and AI prompt complexity.\n\n\n**Refining Complex Option**\n\nI\'m now refining the \"Complex/UPSC\" option within the statement depth controls. I\'m focusing on the border styling and hover effects to improve the visual cues, and I am reviewing the tooltip to reflect the associated functionality and AI complexity. I\'ve re-examined the layout to ensure it aligns with other options, to ensure it provides clarity.\n\n\n**Crafting Complex Questions**\n\nI\'m now crafting a multi-statement question for Paper 1. I\'m focusing on incorporating subtle qualifiers like \"only\" and \"exclusive,\" constitutional exceptions, and deductive elimination options to create a more challenging and nuanced question. I\'m exploring the implications of these specific elements.\n\n\n**Adjusting UI Component**\n\nI\'m now making final adjustments to the manual depth control component. I\'m focusing on the logic that updates `complexityTier` based on selected depth, ensuring the visual styling reflects the chosen depth level accurately and consistently. I\'m carefully reviewing the conditional styling.\n\n\n**Analyzing Question Generation**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the logic that generates practice questions. I\'m focusing on the component which handles the number of practice questions generated, specifically how the `questionCount` state is set based on user input (3, 4, or 5). I am also checking the visual feedback to the user on this choice.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_11271485794328790599"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add Question Generation Settings Panel to AiTopicBreakdown\", \"EndLine\":428, \"Instruction\":\"Update Tile 2 and insert Question Generation Settings Panel\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"          {/* Tile 2: Statement Depth Tuning */}\\n          <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#FFFFFF] dark:bg-[#121816] border border-[#EEF0EA] dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-[#5C646B] tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Statement Depth\\n              </span>\\n              <span className={`text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded ${\\n                isManualOverride \\n                  ? \'bg-[#36624B] text-white\' \\n                  : \'bg-[#E3EFE8] text-[#36624B]\'\\n              }`}>\\n                {complexityTier} ({manualDepth} Stmt{manualDepth > 1 ? \'s\' : \'\'})\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            \\n            {/* Visual statement depth bar - 4 depth options */}\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-2 grid grid-cols-4 gap-1 text-center\\\">\\n              {([1, 2, 3, 4] as const).map((depth) => {\\n                const isActive = manualDepth === depth;\\n                return (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={depth}\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setIsManualOverride(true);\\n                      setManualDepth(depth);\\n                      if (depth === 1) setComplexityTier(\'Simple\');\\n                      else if (depth === 2) setComplexityTier(\'Moderate\');\\n                      else setComplexityTier(\'Complex/UPSC\');\\n                    }}\\n                    title={\\n                      depth === 1\\n                        ? \'Simple: 1-Statement direct factual recall\'\\n                        : depth === 2\\n                        ? \'Moderate: 2-Statement binary contrast\'\\n                        : depth === 3\\n                        ? \'Complex/UPSC: 3-Statement standard elimination\'\\n                        : \'Complex/UPSC: 4-Statement advanced analysis\'\\n                    }\\n                    className={`py-1 rounded text-[11px] font-bold border transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                      isActive\\n                        ? \'bg-[#36624B] text-white border-[#36624B] shadow-xs\'\\n                        : \'bg-[#F7F8F5] dark:bg-slate-900 text-[#5C646B] border-[#EEF0EA] hover:border-[#36624B]\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {depth} Stmt{depth > 1 ? \'s\' : \'\'}\\n                  </button>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-1 text-[10px] text-[#5C646B] truncate\\\">\\n              {manualDepth === 1 && \'Simple: Direct factual CBT recall\'}\\n              {manualDepth === 2 && \'Moderate: Binary contrast (1 & 2)\'}\\n              {manualDepth === 3 && \'Complex/UPSC: Elimination (1, 2, 3)\'}\\n              {manualDepth === 4 && \'Complex/UPSC: Analysis (1, 2, 3, 4)\'}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Tile 3: Diagnosed Learning Gap */}\\n          <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#FFFFFF] dark:bg-[#121816] border border-[#EEF0EA] dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-[#5C646B] tracking-wider block\\\">\\n              Diagnosed Learning Gap\\n            </span>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-1\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#FBEAE8] text-[#C25345] inline-block truncate max-w-full\\\">\\n                {currentProficiency.dominantGap !== \'None\' ? currentProficiency.dominantGap : \'Balanced Recall\'}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#5C646B] leading-tight line-clamp-2\\\">\\n              {effectiveAssessment.identifiedGap}\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Tile 4: Targeted Trap Strategy */}\\n          <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#FFFFFF] dark:bg-[#121816] border border-[#EEF0EA] dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-[#5C646B] tracking-wider block\\\">\\n              Targeted Trap Directive\\n            </span>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-1\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#E3EFE8] text-[#36624B] inline-block\\\">\\n                {effectiveAssessment.trapTypeToInject}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-[10px] text-[#5C646B] leading-tight\\\">\\n              {effectiveAssessment.trapTypeToInject === \'Subtle Qualifier\' && \'Tests precision against \\\"only\\\", \\\"all\\\", \\\"exclusive\\\" tricks.\'}\\n              {effectiveAssessment.trapTypeToInject === \'Conceptual Contrast\' && \'Sharp contrast between easily conflated articles/provisions.\'}\\n              {effectiveAssessment.trapTypeToInject === \'Pacing & Elimination\' && \'Multi-statement elimination requiring 2-stage deductive reduction.\'}\\n              {effectiveAssessment.trapTypeToInject === \'None\' && \'Standard conceptual verification.\'}\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Algorithm Rationale Banner */}\\n        <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#FFFFFF] dark:bg-[#121816] border border-[#36624B]/20 text-xs flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n          <AlertCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-[#36624B] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" />\\n          <div className=\\\"text-[#1E252B] dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n            <strong className=\\\"text-[#36624B] dark:text-[#88D4A8]\\\">Adaptive Engine Rationale: </strong>\\n            {effectiveAssessment.rationale}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Settings Panel: Question Statement Depth & Calibration */}\\n      <div className=\\\"bg-[#FFFFFF] dark:bg-[#1A2420] rounded-xl border border-[#36624B]/30 shadow-xs overflow-hidden transition-all\\\">\\n        {/* Settings Panel Header Bar */}\\n        <div \\n          onClick={() => setShowSettingsPanel(!showSettingsPanel)}\\n          className=\\\"p-4 bg-[#FAFBF9] dark:bg-[#151D1A] border-b border-[#E2E6DD] dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer group\\\"\\n        >\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#36624B]/10 text-[#36624B] dark:text-[#88D4A8] flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n              <Settings className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <h3 className=\\\"font-bold text-sm text-[#1E252B] dark:text-white\\\">\\n                  Question Generation Settings Panel\\n                </h3>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#E3EFE8] text-[#36624B] dark:bg-[#1A2E24] dark:text-[#88D4A8] border border-[#36624B]/20\\\">\\n                  {complexityTier} ({manualDepth} Stmts)\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                Toggle Question Statement Depth (Simple, Moderate, Complex/UPSC) to calibrate AI prompt complexity\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#36624B] dark:text-[#88D4A8] group-hover:underline\\\">\\n            <span>{showSettingsPanel ? \'Hide Settings\' : \'Configure Settings\'}</span>\\n            {showSettingsPanel ? <ChevronUp className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" /> : <ChevronDown className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Expanded Settings Controls */}\\n        {showSettingsPanel && (\\n          <div className=\\\"p-5 space-y-5\\\">\\n            {/* 1. Primary Statement Depth Toggle: Simple / Moderate / Complex/UPSC */}\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\\\">\\n                <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1E252B] dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                  <SlidersHorizontal className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#36624B]\\\" />\\n                  <span>Question Statement Depth:</span>\\n                </label>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  Calibrates prompt structure for Gemini question generator\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3\\\">\\n                {/* Simple */}\\n                <div\\n                  onClick={() => handleToggleComplexityTier(\'Simple\')}\\n                  className={`p-4 rounded-xl border cursor-pointer transition-all ${\\n                    complexityTier === \'Simple\'\\n                      ? \'bg-[#E3EFE8]/50 dark:bg-[#162A1F] border-[#36624B] shadow-xs ring-1 ring-[#36624B]\'\\n                      : \'bg-white dark:bg-[#121816] border-[#E2E6DD] dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-[#36624B]/40\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-bold text-xs text-[#1E252B] dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                      <span className={`w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full ${complexityTier === \'Simple\' ? \'bg-[#36624B]\' : \'bg-slate-300\'}`} />\\n                      Simple\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#F7F8F5] dark:bg-slate-800 text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                      1 Statement\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#36624B] dark:text-[#88D4A8] mb-1\\\">\\n                    Direct Factual Recall & CBT Speed\\n                  </div>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                    Single direct objective question without numbered statements. Tests exact constitutional articles, numbers, years, and speed formulas (&lt;30s).\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Moderate */}\\n                <div\\n                  onClick={() => handleToggleComplexityTier(\'Moderate\')}\\n                  className={`p-4 rounded-xl border cursor-pointer transition-all ${\\n                    complexityTier === \'Moderate\'\\n                      ? \'bg-[#E3EFE8]/50 dark:bg-[#162A1F] border-[#36624B] shadow-xs ring-1 ring-[#36624B]\'\\n                      : \'bg-white dark:bg-[#121816] border-[#E2E6DD] dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-[#36624B]/40\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-bold text-xs text-[#1E252B] dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                      <span className={`w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full ${complexityTier === \'Moderate\' ? \'bg-[#2F7C7E]\' : \'bg-slate-300\'}`} />\\n                      Moderate\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#F7F8F5] dark:bg-slate-800 text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                      2 Statements\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#2F7C7E] dark:text-[#88D4A8] mb-1\\\">\\n                    Binary Contrast & Core Concepts\\n                  </div>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                    Two contrasting numbered statements (1 and 2) with \\\"1 only\\\", \\\"2 only\\\", \\\"Both 1 and 2\\\", and \\\"Neither\\\". Eliminates binary confusion between related concepts.\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Complex/UPSC */}\\n                <div\\n                  onClick={() => handleToggleComplexityTier(\'Complex/UPSC\')}\\n                  className={`p-4 rounded-xl border cursor-pointer transition-all ${\\n                    complexityTier === \'Complex/UPSC\'\\n                      ? \'bg-[#E3EFE8]/50 dark:bg-[#162A1F] border-[#36624B] shadow-xs ring-1 ring-[#36624B]\'\\n                      : \'bg-white dark:bg-[#121816] border-[#E2E6DD] dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-[#36624B]/40\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-bold text-xs text-[#1E252B] dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                      <span className={`w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full ${complexityTier === \'Complex/UPSC\' ? \'bg-[#D97746]\' : \'bg-slate-300\'}`} />\\n                      Complex/UPSC\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#F7F8F5] dark:bg-slate-800 text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                      3\342\200\2234 Statements\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#D97746] mb-1\\\">\\n                    Multi-Layered Analytical Elimination\\n                  </div>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                    Canonical UPSC CAPF Paper 1 multi-statement question with subtle qualifiers (\\\"only\\\", \\\"exclusive\\\"), constitutional exceptions, and deductive elimination options.\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* 2. Sub-Parameters (Exact Statement Count & Question Count) */}\\n            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-[#E2E6DD] dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n              {/* Exact Statement Count */}\\n              <div>\\n                <label className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-400 block mb-1.5\\\">\\n                  Exact Statement Count:\\n                </label>\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 text-center\\\">\\n                  {([1, 2, 3, 4] as const).map((d) => {\\n                    const isSelected = manualDepth === d;\\n                    return (\\n                      <button\\n                        key={d}\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => {\\n                          setManualDepth(d);\\n                          setIsManualOverride(true);\\n                          if (d === 1) setComplexityTier(\'Simple\');\\n                          else if (d === 2) setComplexityTier(\'Moderate\');\\n                          else setComplexityTier(\'Complex/UPSC\');\\n                        }}\\n                        className={`py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold border transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                          isSelected\\n                            ? \'bg-[#36624B] text-white border-[#36624B] shadow-2xs\'\\n                            : \'bg-[#F7F8F5] dark:bg-[#121816] text-[#5C646B] border-[#E2E6DD] dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-[#36624B]\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        {d} Stmt{d > 1 ? \'s\' : \'\'}\\n                      </button>\\n                    );\\n                  })}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Question Count */}\\n              <div>\\n                <label className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-400 block mb-1.5\\\">\\n                  Practice Questions to Generate:\\n                </label>\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-1.5\\\">\\n                  {[3, 4, 5].map((cnt) => (\\n                    <button\\n                      key={cnt}\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setQuestionCount(cnt)}\\n                      className={`py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold border transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                        questionCount === cnt\\n                          ? \'bg-[#36624B] text-white border-[#36624B] shadow-2xs\'\\n                          : \'bg-[#F7F8F5] dark:bg-[#121816] text-[#5C646B] border-[#E2E6DD] dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-[#36624B]\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      {cnt} Questions\\n                    </button>\\n                  ))}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Prompt Parameter Monospace Preview */}\\n              <div className=\\\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\\\">\\n                <label className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5C646B] dark:text-slate-400 block mb-1.5\\\">\\n                  Dispatched AI Prompt Directive:\\n                </label>\\n                <div className=\\\"p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#F7F8F5] dark:bg-[#121816] border border-[#E2E6DD] dark:border-slate-800 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#36624B] dark:text-[#88D4A8] space-y-0.5 leading-snug\\\">\\n                  <div>complexityTier: \\\"{complexityTier}\\\"</div>\\n                  <div>statementDepth: {manualDepth} statements</div>\\n                  <div>count: {questionCount} | mode: {examTrackChoice}</div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n      </div>\", \"StartLine\":327, \"TargetContent\":\"          {/* Tile 2: Statement Depth Tuning */}\\n          <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#FFFFFF] dark:bg-[#121816] border border-[#EEF0EA] dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-[#5C646B] tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Statement Depth\\n              </span>\\n              <span className={`text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded ${\\n                isManualOverride \\n                  ? \'bg-[#36624B] text-white\' \\n                  : \'bg-[#E3EFE8] text-[#36624B]\'\\n              }`}>\\n                {effectiveAssessment.statementDepth} Stmt{effectiveAssessment.statementDepth > 1 ? \'s\' : \'\'} {isManualOverride ? \'(Manual)\' : \'(Auto)\'}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            \\n            {/* Visual statement depth bar - 4 depth options */}\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-2 grid grid-cols-4 gap-1 text-center\\\">\\n              {([1, 2, 3, 4] as const).map((depth) => {\\n                const isActive = effectiveAssessment.statementDepth === depth;\\n                return (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={depth}\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setIsManualOverride(true);\\n                      setManualDepth(depth);\\n                    }}\\n                    title={\\n                      depth === 1\\n                        ? \'1 Stmt: Single-statement factual recall\'\\n                        : depth === 2\\n                        ? \'2 Stmts: Foundational binary contrast\'\\n                        : depth === 3\\n                        ? \'3 Stmts: Standard UPSC CAPF elimination\'\\n                        : \'4 Stmts: Complex multi-layered analysis\'\\n                    }\\n                    className={`py-1 rounded text-[11px] font-bold border transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                      isActive\\n                        ? \'bg-[#36624B] text-white border-[#36624B] shadow-xs\'\\n                        : \'bg-[#F7F8F5] dark:bg-slate-900 text-[#5C646B] border-[#EEF0EA] hover:border-[#36624B]\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {depth} Stmt{depth > 1 ? \'s\' : \'\'}\\n                  </button>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-1 text-[10px] text-[#5C646B] truncate\\\">\\n              {effectiveAssessment.statementDepth === 1 && \'Factual recall (Direct CBT format)\'}\\n              {effectiveAssessment.statementDepth === 2 && \'Remedial / Binary contrast (1 & 2)\'}\\n              {effectiveAssessment.statementDepth === 3 && \'Standard UPSC elimination (1, 2, 3)\'}\\n              {effectiveAssessment.statementDepth === 4 && \'Complex analysis (1, 2, 3, 4)\'}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Tile 3: Diagnosed Learning Gap */}\\n          <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#FFFFFF] dark:bg-[#121816] border border-[#EEF0EA] dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-[#5C646B] tracking-wider block\\\">\\n              Diagnosed Learning Gap\\n            </span>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-1\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#FBEAE8] text-[#C25345] inline-block truncate max-w-full\\\">\\n                {currentProficiency.dominantGap !== \'None\' ? currentProficiency.dominantGap : \'Balanced Recall\'}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#5C646B] leading-tight line-clamp-2\\\">\\n              {effectiveAssessment.identifiedGap}\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Tile 4: Targeted Trap Strategy */}\\n          <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#FFFFFF] dark:bg-[#121816] border border-[#EEF0EA] dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-[#5C646B] tracking-wider block\\\">\\n              Targeted Trap Directive\\n            </span>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-1\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#E3EFE8] text-[#36624B] inline-block\\\">\\n                {effectiveAssessment.trapTypeToInject}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-[10px] text-[#5C646B] leading-tight\\\">\\n              {effectiveAssessment.trapTypeToInject === \'Subtle Qualifier\' && \'Tests precision against \\\"only\\\", \\\"all\\\", \\\"exclusive\\\" tricks.\'}\\n              {effectiveAssessment.trapTypeToInject === \'Conceptual Contrast\' && \'Sharp contrast between easily conflated articles/provisions.\'}\\n              {effectiveAssessment.trapTypeToInject === \'Pacing & Elimination\' && \'Multi-statement elimination requiring 2-stage deductive reduction.\'}\\n              {effectiveAssessment.trapTypeToInject === \'None\' && \'Standard conceptual verification.\'}\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Algorithm Rationale Banner */}\\n        <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#FFFFFF] dark:bg-[#121816] border border-[#36624B]/20 text-xs flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n          <AlertCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-[#36624B] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" />\\n          <div className=\\\"text-[#1E252B] dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n            <strong className=\\\"text-[#36624B] dark:text-[#88D4A8]\\\">Adaptive Engine Rationale: </strong>\\n            {effectiveAssessment.rationale}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/AiTopicBreakdown.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding Settings Panel\", \"toolSummary\":\"Insert Question Generation Settings Panel into AiTopicBreakdown\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\217\211\001\n\213\211\001\001i\024}\023\346}Q=(=`w\361\272\275\"I\350vP\004\262\226\240\342\334\3148\201&\330/\301P\271\035\376\320:\266\rbP\003^D>>\225\262\203)m$p\301u\340y\023\005\314kXM\225\202g\b\360\333\257\306\355\334\313\323\344_o\340\215\235Imu\031 Z\350\225iYL7zR\270*\231\364Fo=G\033\267\001\312R\235B*\201\336\275\243\va#\315\270\367\3121\262\005} \326\333\271P\366\a\343E\275\231\214\350*\306\310b)V\350\224\345\027p\365a\232$\217\373j\037\235\200\276i\0366Cw\316\370=$\231\3006\261\361\367^\252RCc\300]\323\213\2451\234\244ja\002\v\235\217\230\247\375\204Zo\365\214\256\033u{\315 n_\207E\240s\342 \306\v\220\366\003\216\230\233\347\3134\342O\334\'\031\305L\3263\235\025\342\245\037\212i/\251\200\370|\361%(\213F\264\002\347\363\206\267\343h\261\312,\376\334UX\rj\0217-p\303\236\212t\000\214\317\221\354\344\340Pe\3511\t70\212D,\0038\252\252X\3735O\221\204\372\220\210&|\017#\262\025j\005^q\316\325$\021\006\372\337\213\211\365\222\302W:\020y\002\"u6S%\242\251\262\020\346M\370\271&36\337\336@n\355\364+\001\251d\034\'Q\213\031\227\224s\341v\357-<\235\252\204\347.\367\004\235\265\212\367\363<j\336?\232\241$E\265\b\243\235x\315\250\024\203\033QT\345\300]\370\341\347\243\304[\237}\270\324\337\345\247\330M\177.(G\357+\037S\375\327\353@\016`U\251\00428[y\344K\220\021\016\272L\207\2654\030:zA9\033a\233\320\316\023\301\202\323\021d\251Gd\252\315\237\031\254A\207{\324\003\022\325\266M]\217h\032*\214\334\347\n\344M<\270\310\363\307\335\326!Z5\2108B\277\267/\352\246\257\004I\027md\251\002\223\211\177\221\203\343\032\344\253\2419A2}\214\314\000\016v->~\025\235Z\233Q;\024\351\241}\033\373\016\347\016\246}\fzYx\241\207h\265^\316\227\247}j\314\257\036;/\300\277\017\372mPQHz\226\231y\344}\364\\2Q\036\262a^\025\203\300L9\303|\n\255\303\201e\360\313O\331\214J\3744>{\211\230u\0014~\353\256\225\026\355\005\003L\207\212\324\370g\245\237d\036\350\343l\267\317\3114q\304\377a\346*\001\027@f\365\374\271\334\227\367{i\026ky\370Y\344\0351\266\037\212K7\242\375\2