  planner_response {
    response: "### What was built & delivered\n\nA dedicated **Question Generation Settings Panel** has been added directly within the `AiTopicBreakdown` component, and the backend AI generation prompt has been updated to accept and enforce these complexity parameters.\n\n---\n\n### Key Implementations\n\n1. **Question Generation Settings Panel (`src/components/AiTopicBreakdown.tsx`)**:\n   - **Collapsible Control Header**: A dedicated panel with expand/collapse toggle (`Hide Settings` / `Configure Settings`) displaying the currently active calibration state (e.g. `Complex/UPSC (3 Stmts)`).\n   - **Question Statement Depth Toggles**:\n     - **Simple (1 Statement)**: Direct single-statement factual recall designed for SSC CPO speed drills (<30s). Disables 1, 2, 3 multi-statement structures and tests exact constitutional articles, numbers, years, and shortcut formulas.\n     - **Moderate (2 Statements)**: Foundational binary contrast questions with classic elimination options: *\"1 only\"*, *\"2 only\"*, *\"Both 1 and 2\"*, and *\"Neither 1 nor 2\"*.\n     - **Complex/UPSC (3\342\200\2234 Statements)**: Multi-layered analytical elimination replicating the canonical UPSC CAPF Paper 1 standard, featuring subtle qualifiers (*\"only\"*, *\"all\"*, *\"exclusive\"*), constitutional exceptions (e.g., Articles 33\342\200\22335, 358 vs. 359), and layered distractors.\n   - **Exact Statement Count Fine-Tuning**: Quick selectors for `1 Stmt`, `2 Stmts`, `3 Stmts`, and `4 Stmts`.\n   - **Practice Question Count**: Choose between `3`, `4`, or `5` generated questions per batch.\n   - **Live Prompt Directive Preview**: Monospace live-sync box displaying the exact parameters sent to Gemini (`complexityTier`, `statementDepth`, `questionCount`, `diagnosedGap`).\n\n2. **Backend AI Prompt & Generator Update (`server.ts`)**:\n   - The `/api/ai/generate-questions` route now accepts `complexityTier` (`\'Simple\' | \'Moderate\' | \'Complex/UPSC\'`) and `statementDepth` (`1 | 2 | 3 | 4`).\n   - **System Instruction**: Formulates strict structural guidelines per complexity tier:\n     - *Simple*: Strictly `SINGLE_CHOICE`, empty `statements: []`, direct 4 alternatives testing quick recall.\n     - *Moderate*: Exactly 2 high-contrast numbered statements with binary options (`1 only`, `2 only`, `Both`, `Neither`).\n     - *Complex/UPSC*: 3\342\200\2234 numbered statements with analytical deduction, subtle qualifier traps, and combinatorial elimination options (`1 and 2 only`, `2 and 3 only`, etc.).\n   - **User Prompt**: Injects explicit complexity tier directives and specific learning gap targets.\n   - **Fallback Generator**: Calibrated to match `Simple` (1 Stmt CBT), `Moderate` (2 Stmts Binary Contrast), and `Complex/UPSC` (3\342\200\2234 Stmts Analytical) when offline or generating without API keys.\n\n3. **Inline Error Handling & Verification**:\n   - Replaced browser `alert()` popups with inline dismissible alert banners for environment compliance.\n   - All 17 unit tests pass cleanly (`npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/*.test.ts`).\n   - Clean compilation (`compile_applet`) and TypeScript check (`lint_applet`).\n   - Verified live in Playwright CLI with visual screenshots capturing the settings panel and tier transitions."
