| 4`).\n   - **System Instruction**: Formulates strict structural guidelines per complexity tier:\n     - *Simple*: Strictly `SINGLE_CHOICE`, empty `statements: []`, direct 4 alternatives testing quick recall.\n     - *Moderate*: Exactly 2 high-contrast numbered statements with binary options (`1 only`, `2 only`, `Both`, `Neither`).\n     - *Complex/UPSC*: 3\342\200\2234 numbered statements with analytical deduction, subtle qualifier traps, and combinatorial elimination options (`1 and 2 only`, `2 and 3 only`, etc.).\n   - **User Prompt**: Injects explicit complexity tier directives and specific learning gap targets.\n   - **Fallback Generator**: Calibrated to match `Simple` (1 Stmt CBT), `Moderate` (2 Stmts Binary Contrast), and `Complex/UPSC` (3\342\200\2234 Stmts Analytical) when offline or generating without API keys.\n\n3. **Inline Error Handling & Verification**:\n   - Replaced browser `alert()` popups with inline dismissible alert banners for environment compliance.\n   - All 17 unit tests pass cleanly (`npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/*.test.ts`).\n   - Clean compilation (`compile_applet`) and TypeScript check (`lint_applet`).\n   - Verified live in Playwright CLI with visual screenshots capturing the settings panel and tier transitions."
